    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"2\">Level 2 - Beginner</span><span class=\"time\">15 min</span><span class=\"chip ok\">Easy</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Hashing</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/two-sum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 1</a></div>\n  <h1>Two Sum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: for each value x, the only partner that works is target - x, so ask a hash map \"have I already seen target - x?\" before storing x. One pass, O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
